    "text": "15 hours ago For more than a decade, Ryan Yarosik sat next to one of the most accomplished boys basketball coaches in Westmoreland County. Now, Yarosik is at the helm of a program once again. Yarosik was promoted late last month as the head coach of Greater Latrobe boys basketball, following the resignation of longtime head coach Brad Wetzel earlier this offseason. Read full article",
